 "description": "Quick cash-price ballpark for one or more CPT codes, using the median cash price across hospitals in the state (from zip_code) or nationally. priceRange is the typical range (25th to 75th percentile of hospitals). Codes without enough data return insufficient_data and are listed in missingCodes; the total is null unless every code has data. Never fill gaps with your own estimate. For insurer rates or hospital-specific prices, use get_market_pricing or get_hospital_pricing.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
